WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:07.880
Buying work fairly takes care, whether you are a public body or a private organisation.

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:14.130
Velstrian Buy helps you run a clear, consistent process, from requirement to award and supplier reviews.

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:18.300
Build a requirement step by step, or start from a template.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:27.670
Your pipeline lists upcoming and current contracts. You can download what your pipeline notice needs, and export a contract register.

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:31.840
When bids are in, each evaluator sets their own scores.

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:39.650
Only people set the scores. The total is worked out the same way every time, and AI never sets or changes a mark.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:44.940
Compare bids brings each one to a single whole life figure. It does not rank them for you.

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:50.110
Record the award, then keep the supplier on track with scorecards and reviews.

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:53.720
Velstrian Buy. A clear process you can explain.
